From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:38:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wuapi: asynchronous search jobs, web proxy, empty-update
 install/download results, settings dialog (3231)

BeginSearch/EndSearch with ISearchCompletedCallback (or a script function),
IWebProxy for IWebProxy get/put on the session with credential prompt,
Install/Download/Uninstall with no updates, ShowSettingsDialog.
No server is contacted.

